# Validation 2: an Apprentice wish. The Apprentice matches typed words to ready-made things (no AI, offline),
# offers them on a chest page, and the player's pick is made in the world.
@intent A typed wish goes to Moddy's Apprentice, which offers ready-made picks, and the picked creature appears in the world

@step a clear stage
gamemode creative
time set noon
weather clear
gamerule advance_time false
gamerule spawn_mobs false
tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 10

@step type a wish for the Apprentice
/moddy apprentice a dragon that breathes fire
@expect chat Moddy's Apprentice within 20s
@expect screen Apprentice within 20s
@shot the-apprentice-offers

@step pick its best offer
# Slot 0 is the Apprentice's best match; slot 1 is "wish it from scratch" (the Magician), never picked here.
@click slot 0
@expect chat is ready within 90s
@wait 2s
@shot the-wish-made

@step the creature is in the world
# A wished creature's body carries the tags wishmob and mfamrig (its name varies: Scorch, Torch, ... the Dragon).
# It flies, so look world-wide (a fresh world holds no other wished creature), polling while it settles.
@repeat 10 until execute if entity @e[tag=wishmob,tag=mfamrig]
@wait 1s
@end-repeat
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=wishmob,tag=mfamrig]
